  "published": "2026-06-16T14:39:43.13Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0:\n      - Initial release with full Tink AES256-GCM-HKDF-1MB streaming AEAD interoperability.\n      - Sync, async, and lazy-streaming APIs.\n      - TinkCrypto convenience facade with one-liner file encryption.\n      - Tink JSON keyset extraction.\n      - IAsyncDisposable support on .NET 6+.\n      - Hardened: constant-time key zeroing, CryptographicException for ciphertext errors, uint segment counter.\n      - Verified against Google Tink (Python) ciphertexts and RFC 5869 test vectors.",
